  popDuration: 1
  popOvershoot: 0.5
  dialogueLines:
  - Lola Nida gave me a lot of errands to do.
  - The problem is...
  - I'm not yet familiar with this place yet
  - and she wrote all these directions in the local language!
  - I'm lucky that you're here or else I'd get lost on my own!
